httpx
Usage: httpx -u URL [-sc] [-title] [-server] [-silent] [-nc]

Fast http prober. Give it a URL, or a list of them, and it says which actually
answer and what they are -- status code, page title, the server software, the
tech behind it. The first pass over a set of hosts, before you scan deep.

	-u URL        probe a single url ( -l FILE for a list )
	-sc           show the HTTP status code
	-title        show the page's <title>
	-server       show the Server header
	-tech-detect  name the frameworks/tech it can fingerprint
	-silent -nc   quiet output, no colour -- clean for piping

Only against hosts you own or are authorised to test.

See also: ffuf, nuclei, nmap, subfinder
